---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site, localBusinessSchema } from '../../config/site';

const procedureSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "MedicalProcedure",
  "name": "Dental Implants in Phoenix, AZ",
  "description": "If you are missing one or more teeth, don't settle for gaps in your smile. At Arizona Biltmore Dentistry, we can complete the entire procedure — from placement to restoration — right here in our Phoenix dental office.",
  "procedureType": "https://schema.org/Therapeutic",
  "provider": {
    "@type": "Dentist",
    "name": "Arizona Biltmore Dentistry",
    "address": {
      "@type": "PostalAddress",
      "addressLocality": "Phoenix"
    }
  }
};
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`Dental Implants Phoenix | ${site.name}`}
  description="If you are missing one or more teeth, don't settle for gaps in your smile. At Arizona Biltmore Dentistry, we can complete the entire procedure — from placement to restoration — right here in our Phoenix dental office."
  schema={[localBusinessSchema, procedureSchema]}
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 md:py-24">
    <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-primary mb-4">
      <a href="/services" class="hover:underline">Services</a>
    </p>
    <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-neutral-dark mb-4 leading-tight">
      Dental Implants in Phoenix, AZ
    </h1>
    <p class="text-xl text-neutral-mid mb-8 leading-relaxed">
      If you are missing one or more teeth, don't settle for gaps in your smile. At Arizona Biltmore Dentistry, we can complete the entire procedure — from placement to restoration — right here in our Phoenix dental office.
    </p>
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-neutral-mid leading-relaxed">
      <p class="mb-4">At Arizona Biltmore Dentistry, we see patients who are missing one or more natural teeth due to decay, periodontal disease, or injury. Dental implants represent a meaningful advance in restorative dentistry — artificial tooth roots, placed directly into the jawbone, that support custom restorations closely mirroring the look, feel, and function of natural teeth. By integrating with the bone, implants also preserve jawbone density and facial structure in a way that bridges and traditional dentures cannot. The entire process — from placement to final restoration — is completed in our Phoenix office.</p>
      
    </div>
    <div class="mt-10 flex gap-4 flex-wrap">
      <a href="/schedule" class="btn-primary">Schedule a Consultation</a>
      <a href="/services" class="btn-secondary">View All Services</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pb-16 md:pb-24">
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-neutral-mid leading-relaxed space-y-4">
      <p>Previously, the only treatment options available for patients with missing teeth were dentures and bridges.</p>
      <p>Implant posts are screw-like and are inserted into the jaw bone for stabilization.</p>
      <p>Types include All-on-4 and single-tooth implants.</p>
      <p>Traditional implants can take anywhere from six months to a year to heal.</p>
      <p>Guided implant surgery technology is used at the practice.</p>
      <p>Post-op care instructions are available for extraction/implant procedures.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
